    {
      "id": "CONSIST-007",
      "category": "abstract_overstatement",
      "finding_summary": "The abstract and conclusion report 92 openings and 43 projects from the 3,187-article run without saying that this output was not validated against human coding. The body says a random sample of it still has to be checked.",
