      "evidence_summary": "Section 4.1: 'The only article they disagree on covers a dispute between Stord municipality and Vestland County...' Table 3 shows one article coded not relevant by the pilot coder and relevant by the second coder. Section 4.2 says the LLM disagreement is the same Stord article. Both human coders therefore did not code it as not relevant. The 'both human coders' wording also leaves open whether footnote 3 means something other than the validation coding. Separately, Section 6 describes the 44 projects as ones for which 96 articles 'reported an opening', yet the Stord article mentions a path 'completed the year before' only in passing. The 44 figure includes this non-opening, which Section 5 and the conclusion do not use (43).",
