      "claim_text": "A pilot of 70 search hits ... contained only two actual openings, showing that keyword search alone is too noisy and that an LLM filter is needed.",
      "assessment": "partially",
      "cannot_verify_reason": null,
      "evidence_summary": "Section 3.1.1 states that preliminary searches return between about 530 ('åpning sykkelvei') and 13 800 ('sykkelvei') hits depending on keywords. The pilot uses only 'sykkelvei', over 2 September to 10 October 2026. Section 3.1.2 says the low yield 'points to the need for an LLM to filter the articles'. A more specific keyword such as 'åpning sykkelvei' was not evaluated, so the pilot cannot show that no keyword search suffices. The conclusion in the abstract is stronger than the body's own wording.",
