      "assessment": "partially",
      "cannot_verify_reason": null,
      "evidence_summary": "The literature review says that selection bias and description bias 'both apply to our setting, where small projects in rural municipalities may be less likely to be covered'. Section 5 reports 236 outlets and 50 outlets covering the relevant articles, with most projects covered by one or two articles. Validation covers only articles already retrieved by the keyword search, so missed openings, meaning recall, are not assessed. Section 8 lists comparison of coverage across regions as future work. The conclusion is hedged with 'potential', but it omits these limits on completeness and representativeness.",
